ficance was defined as p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sensitivity calculations were conducted to assess the magnitude of potential bias.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"p<0.05 by t-test for comparisons, with non-Hispanic white as the reference.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"p<0.05 by t-test for comparisons between 2012 and 2011 within each level of each characteristic.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}